title: "repository-entity-store: get, create and change a 100-byte entity"
abstract: >
  Side 5 of the fabric hexagon: an interface that gets, creates and changes
  entities, over the iceoryx2 ring transport-ingest-python opens. A skeleton --
  the environment resolves and the generated codec is present, and the repository
  itself is not written.
